OL,3,AMan killed by falling tree as Storm
OL,4,ABoelo leaves more than 160,000
OL,5,Aproperties without power
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man has died after being hit by a
OL,8,Ftree, as Storm Boelo brings flooding,
OL,9,Ftravel disruption, and power cuts to
OL,10,Fthe UK
OL,12,FThe 60-year-old was hit at 10:30 GMT
OL,13,Fnear Castle Douglas in Dumfries and
OL,14,FGalloway - police say there are no
OL,15,Fsuspicious circumstances
OL,17,FMore than 160,000 properties in the UK
OL,18,Fwere still without power as of 15:00,
OL,19,Faccording to the industry body - there
OL,20,Fwere also power cuts across the island
OL,21,Fof Ireland
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
