OL,3,ALetter making claims about Meghan's
OL,4,Afather written by his first wife, BBC
OL,5,Aunderstands
OL,6,
OL,7,FA letter sent to the Metropolitan
OL,8,FPolice making a number of claims
OL,9,Frelating to the Duchess of Sussex's
OL,10,Ffather was written by his ex-wife
OL,11,FRoslyn Loveless, the BBC understands.
OL,13,FMeghan confirmed on Friday she had
OL,14,Fpreviously been informed about
OL,15,F"disturbing allegations" about her
OL,16,Festranged father, Thomas Markle.
OL,18,FOn Saturday, the Met confirmed it
OL,19,Freceived a letter relating to Markle in
OL,20,F2019, and it was shared with the Duke
OL,21,Fand Duchess of Sussex at the time.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
