OL,3,ABurnham open to 'honest discussion' on
OL,4,AEU free movement
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister says he would
OL,7,Fwelcome an "honest discussion" about
OL,8,Fthe prospect of returning to free
OL,9,Fmovement between the UK and European
OL,10,FUnion.
OL,12,FSpeaking to the Sunday Times, Andy
OL,13,FBurnham said a new relationship with
OL,14,FBrussels could include full EU
OL,15,Fmembership or joining the single
OL,16,Fmarket, requiring free movement.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
