OL,3,AEarly reports suggest record high
OL,4,Aturnout in Serbia elections
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarly reports suggest Serbian voters
OL,7,Fturned out in droves for its
OL,8,Fparliamentary election, as a student
OL,9,Fprotest movement attempts to end the
OL,10,Frule of the country's right-wing
OL,11,Fpopulist leader.
OL,13,FPreliminary figures provided by
OL,14,FSerbia's election commission suggested
OL,15,Fa record high turnout, with 64.9%
OL,16,Fhaving cast their vote by 18:00 local
OL,17,Ftime (17:00 GMT), two hours before
OL,18,Fpolls were set to close.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
