OL,3,AEarly reports suggest record high
OL,4,Aturnout in Serbia elections
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe apparent high participation is
OL,7,Ffuelling the hopes of opposition party
OL,8,FStudent List that they can oust
OL,9,FAleksandar VuDMiDG and his Serbian
OL,10,FProgressive Party (SNS), who have been
OL,11,Fin power since 2012.
OL,13,FThe snap elections called by VuDMiDG
OL,14,Ffollow two years of student protests
OL,15,Ftriggered by the 2024 collapse of a
OL,16,Ftrain station canopy, which killed 16
OL,17,Fand was seen as emblematic of
OL,18,Fcorruption and negligence in Serbia.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
